  <section class="product-faq"><header><p class="eyebrow">FAQ</p><h2>Commercial control stays with you.</h2></header><div><details><summary>Does AI set my prices?</summary><p>No. Rubusoo may locate an existing price source, but missing price, freight, tax or configuration amounts block formal sending until a person confirms them.</p></details><details><summary>Can buyers change a formal quote?</summary><p>No. Buyer choices and requests are stored separately. Only the seller can publish a new immutable Revision.</p></details><details><summary>What happens after acceptance?</summary><p>Rubusoo locks the Revision, buyer selection, amount, terms and accepter details. The resulting PI uses that snapshot even if the working quote later changes.</p></details></div></section>

